    <!-- ABOUT HERO -->

    <section class="about-hero section">

        <p class="eyebrow">GET TO KNOW RETHREAD</p>

        <h1>Every thread has a story.
            <br>
            <span>We give it another.</span>
        </h1>

        <p>
            ReThread is about seeing potential where others
            see unwanted clothing. We believe that clothes
            can have more than one purpose and that even
            small actions can create meaningful change.
        </p>

    </section>


    <!-- OUR STORY -->

    <section class="story section">

        <p class="eyebrow">OUR STORY</p>

        <h2>Where it all begins.</h2>

        <p>
            ReThread began with a simple thought:
            what if clothes that people no longer needed
            could be transformed into something useful
            for someone else?
        </p>

        <p>
            Instead of allowing unwanted textiles to become
            waste, we wanted to find a way to give them
            another purpose. This idea led to the creation
            of ReThread, an initiative that brings together
            clothing donations, creativity and community
            participation.
        </p>

        <p>
            By gathering donated clothes and working
            together to repurpose their fabrics, we hope
            to create useful household essentials for
            people who need them.
        </p>

    </section>


    <!-- THE PROBLEM -->

    <section class="problem section">

        <p class="eyebrow">THE PROBLEM WE ADDRESS</p>

        <h2>Two issues. One opportunity.</h2>

        <div class="problem-content">

            <div class="problem-card">

                <h3>Textile Waste</h3>

                <p>
                    Clothes are often discarded when people
                    no longer want or need them. Many of these
                    textiles still have the potential to be
                    reused, repurposed or transformed into
                    something useful.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="problem-card">

                <h3>Everyday Essentials</h3>

                <p>
                    Many underprivileged individuals and
                    families face difficulties accessing
                    basic household items. Useful products
                    such as blankets and pillow covers can
                    make a difference in everyday life.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

        <p class="problem-ending">
            ReThread aims to connect these two issues
            through the power of reuse and community.
        </p>

    </section>


    <!-- OUR VISION -->

    <section class="vision section">

        <p class="eyebrow">LOOKING AHEAD</p>

        <h2>Our Vision</h2>

        <p>
            We envision a community where clothing is
            valued beyond its original purpose, where
            reusable textiles are given new life rather
            than discarded, and where people come together
            to support those in need.
        </p>

        <p>
            Through ReThread, we hope to encourage more
            responsible habits, inspire creativity and
            demonstrate how collective efforts can
            create a positive difference.
        </p>

    </section>


    <!-- OUR VALUES -->

    <section class="values section">

        <p class="eyebrow">WHAT GUIDES US</p>

        <h2>What We Stand For</h2>

        <div class="values-list">

            <div class="value-item">

                <h3>01. Sustainability</h3>

                <p>
                    Making better use of existing materials
                    and reducing unnecessary textile waste.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="value-item">

                <h3>02. Creativity</h3>

                <p>
                    Finding new possibilities in old fabrics
                    and transforming them into useful products.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="value-item">

                <h3>03. Community</h3>

                <p>
                    Bringing people together through
                    volunteering, collaboration and giving.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="value-item">

                <h3>04. Compassion</h3>

                <p>
                    Creating something meaningful for
                    individuals and families who need support.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


